SY_TALK("iJmW6J8zWRo",[[1,["Because many people have written about it","(inaudible) and a lot of people have been thinking that"]],[8,["something should be done in this matter","of finding the truth. (Unclear)"]],[19,["Now when human (inaudible) his condition would be such","that he only believes this thing (inaudible)","and he has no other means."]],[37,["Whatever have been the achievements of Science, we have","seen only through the medium of intellect."]],[45,["But the intelligence that is, tells us only about what","is visible in the world. It tells us nothing about what","is invisible or can’t be seen."]],[56,["And can’t even tell what is the difference","between the Truth and invisible."]],[61,["Then it should be thought first that when a person","talks of the search for Truth then first of all","he has to consider"]],[71,["that whatever we have known through the intellect, have","known nothing, even then we remained in illusion."]],[77,["What we have known through our intelligence,","whatever we have known till now, that much has happened,"]],[84,["we have known from what is visible (UNCLEAR) but","have not known what is in the invisible or hidden."]],[90,["And could not even know that what we have to know from","what is visible whether it is the Absolute Truth or not."]],[99,["Now when the achievement of Science is ours, then Science","is on our heads, we have known a lot through Science."]],[107,["We have reached up to the atom and molecule.","The activities that we have understood are also","of all that is gross or non-living."]],[120,["..... How it happens with everyone in the world,","no one has any attention towards it."]],[127,["The first thing to be thought about in the search","for Truth, that whatever man can do,","is there any creation beyond that or not?"]],[138,["For example, as we watch any living thing - a human-being","walking, strolling, growing, becoming anxious, see everything,"]],[147,["but we don't look this way, we don’t visualize/pay","attention to the fact, why is this man made - first thing,"]],[160,["because we don't have an answer to it. The speciality","of man is that he turns his face away from the fact","to which he does not have an answer."]],[170,["And says that, he would like to stay at the point","to which he has an answer. He thinks that it","would be wrong to go beyond that point."]],[181,["But man came into the world, Science told us","that man has been created/made from an amoeba."]],[189,["Then it should immediately come to our minds","that such special events that have happened,"]],[198,["and because of which they are all inferior to us,","these are inert/inanimate things, we can make them."]],[206,["Man's vision reaches there, that okay","we're making it, so we made it and we","have become a very great person"]],[213,["or we have done a very great work. But even a stone","cannot be made by man, not even an atom or","molecule of it."]],[222,["Only if man could think with a little humility that,","\"Can I make this stone myself?"]],[231,["Of all the elements, can I make even a single element myself?"]],[238,["It’s valances etc. are made so beautifully","can I create something like this?\""]],[244,["It's okay, that you’ve assembled a dead thing.","But in it’s creation can you have any"]],[254,["intervention – you cannot have.","You can't change anything about/in it."]],[262,["As it is, so shall it remain. You can make it’s","compounds, can make mixtures from it."]],[270,["But if sulphur is burnt and if we make crystals from it,","they will be made in the same way as they are made of sulphur."]],[280,["Now if you want to create your own style of","crystals, you cannot create even that."]],[285,["You can not interfere in it’s properties.","Yes, you can use those properties"]],[292,["but you cannot change their basic fundamental properties."]],[304,["So who has made this and in whose power is it that He","can change it? Here also one should have a point of view."]],[313,["Living in the dark, if you say that there is","no light, then this would be wrong."]],[320,["But if someone says that there is light, then,","be it any scientist, any intellectual man,"]],[327,["he should say that if there is light we should","see it. There must be curiosity or inquisitiveness."]],[332,["There should be curiosity in the mind of man that, after all","if he is saying that there is some light beyond it,","so why not have a look?"]],[341,["But the way we are influenced by ourselves,","there's so much autohypnosis,"]],[348,["that we think that whatever we can work out","only that is true and what we cannot work out,","there’s no need to look there."]],[357,["Thus you can understand how far away we are from Truth,","that we haven’t even touched it’s basic facts."]],[367,["The first question is that the One who created the universe","that is created, and Who has made such a beautiful arrangement","in all the molecules, particles and atoms of this universe,"]],[374,["Who has made it so systematically,","Who is this administrator?"]],[386,["One thing can be said that people are honest,","that say, ‘We can't go any further than this,","so we’ll stay here.’"]],[392,["But if we say, you can grow,","you can go further than this,"]],[399,["and beyond this there is another area, another","dimension, so why not open your eyes to all this?"]],[411,["We have only an ego that, \"We have done this,","we have found this out, we have this, that,","but whatever it is, it is inferior to you."]],[425,["If you want to rise above, anywhere, you","have to hold on to something above."]],[433,["Wherever one has to climb - you must have seen that when people","climb a big hill, then they hammer a nail up there first","and then hold it."]],[443,["This is what you call hypothesis etc. in","Science where an assumption has to be made."]],[448,["Nailed the nail of that concept, then holding","up that nail rose higher, and then went","forward to see what happens."]],[457,["Whether the nail is actually nailed or not, whether","we have reached there or not, a person can only","see after reaching there in reality."]],[466,["But by turning away completely, this work","is not going to happen."]],[472,["Now if we say that those who great saints and sages that","have been, the great Incarnations who have incarnated here","In India, in this land of yoga,"]],[481,["who have done great deeds, whom till this day","the world is worshipping and believing in,"]],[487,["these people didn't lie, so you would say,","\"Yes, they used to lie, what is the proof of this?\""]],[493,["If you say so, then we can’t stop you."]],[498,["Whether there is God or not, this too if it is","now a matter of debate, we can't stop you."]],[505,["But if we say that we prove it to you,","then why not move in that direction."]],[512,["If you are a worshipper of Truth and you","want to know the Truth, if someone says","that you can progress in it,"]],[520,["not only this but you can know that Truth completely,","then why don't we most humbly accept that,"]],[528,["\"Okay, let's go and see, which is the path Mother is telling?","Let's see whether it is correct or not.”"]],[533,["Accepted that this thing was not universal till now,","was not collective and very few people knew about it"]],[541,["That's why there were misunderstandings, but just","like there are things of Science electricity etc.,","as many as/whatever are discovered,"]],[548,["the way they are collective and global today","and are used for the common good,"]],[554,["when we want to get to something higher than this,","then the things we have used till date"]],[561,["to attain the things lower than us and","acquire them, not only this,"]],[566,["in order to have authority over them, we","have to give up the use of those things."]],[570,["For example, if you want to move around in Delhi,","then car is fine but if you want to go/fly up,","you need an aeroplane."]],[577,["It’s speed is also different, it’s modus operandi","or style is different, all it’s projects are different."]],[584,["The motor-car is a different thing, it moves on the","ground and this is an air-plane flying in the sky."]],[590,["Similarly, when I am saying to you,","that you have to know the Spirit,"]],[595,["the Spirit has to be used, with the help of the","Spirit only you can know the Divine,"]],[603,["so it means that with the help of intelligence only","you understand the whole world, you have come to know,"]],[609,["then you will have to find something","beyond that - that is the Spirit."]],[614,["If there is no mention of the Spirit in Science,","then only this can be said that"]],[618,["yet Science has not been able to move in that","direction, it'll never even come to know"]],[623,["because the limited area from which you want to know","it, it is beyond that, you won't be able to see it."]],[632,["It’s range is not such that that you get to know","it. Thus the range of this machinery, has to be increased."]],[643,["And while increasing that range if I say that,","until the light of the Spirit comes into it"]],[649,["till then the work won’t be done, you must","accept it so that we attain it."]],[656,["As we see a person has a very good microscope"]],[661,["that lets him see how each muscle is and how","is the flow of blood in it, we see all this"]],[670,["but when we see that another person has a","good machine, even better than this one,","so we want somehow to get it."]],[679,["Similarly, if a person sees that","the other person has got something special,"]],[684,["so he should have a desire to achieve that","special thing, but it does not happen."]],[691,["This is not the case with the Spirit because man","only wants to know that, \"What I am today,"]],[698,["I should get everything in it only. If I want to","rise further, means it’s a disrespect to myself only.”"]],[707,["In the case of Science, he doesn’t think so.","In the matter of Science, if America did","some research, he will rush there."]],[714,["Then does not think that, “We are Indians, why should we","run after them.” If Russia did something,","then he will run after them."]],[722,["But if there’s some exploration in some other","area, then man is not interested in it."]],[734,["Man knows all about the outside of the tree","but nothing is known about it’s roots."]],[740,["And to know about it’s roots, you have to become subtle","and to achieve that subtlety, you need humility."]],[751,["If you want that on the basis of your intellect","you achieve it, you can't."]],[758,["One simple thing people don't understand","is whenever I give a speech etc., whatever/anything"]],[763,["then I see the first question is,","that it is written in such-and-such a book -"]],[768,["(It's) done, then what to talk about? Okay, whatever is written","(that) is not going to be judged by your intelligence."]],[776,["You won't be able to understand it. I’m saying","that you will not be able to understand."]],[779,["Please understand, if we can't see without glasses","then it’s important for us to wear glasses - this point","we understand."]],[785,["And, if except the Spirit we can’t know/understand God,","then you should get to the Spirit – this simple","fact why shouldn't you understand!"]],[792,["Will you be able to find the Truth by doubting it?"]],[796,["If in reality you are a worshipper of Truth and","you really want to know the Truth,"]],[801,["so first of all there should be humility that","till now we haven't found the Truth."]],[812,["This is a great virtue – humility."]],[818,["Man learns anything but can't learn humility."]],[828,["What do you do in humility? Some people","get the idea that being humble means","you have bowed down/succumbed before someone."]],[837,["This is a big misconception. Humility means","that you have opened yourself up to accept -"]],[846,["accept a new ideology, to accept something new,","seeing, testing, understanding, getting deep into it."]],[858,["Humility never means that you bow down before someone."]],[863,["No matter how high the branches of the tree","may rise, till its roots"]],[869,["reach the source after digging the ground,","no power of any kind can enter that tree."]],[875,["In the same way no matter how much your civilization/","decency/politeness increases and no matter how much","this mess of Science increases,"]],[883,["but until you have found your Spirit, the whole of it,","will be destroyed, will be finished, just like a bubble."]],[897,["None of this is going to survive and that’s","what has been happening all over the world."]],[903,["I just met a lady who said that they had gone","for the disarmament of the armament,"]],[908,["‘We worked so hard, told the people that there","must be disarmament and everything would be fine","with disarmament and there were many disputes"]],[915,["and there we worked hard for four months and","no one listened and we were great failures.’"]],[921,["Tell me. This means that human-beings are","not left with any intellect."]],[931,["There should be disarmament – even a simple person","can understand that what is the need of one human","going around killing other humans."]],[941,["Except man no animal kills other animals taking arms.","It doesn't have the power even to hold it."]],[951,["God has given us hands, so now we kill others by","taking guns. Is this a matter of great wisdom?"]],[960,["Science cannot treat this, can it?"]],[965,["If scientists can fill wisdom in people,","then I will think them to be great."]],[975,["Intelligence or wisdom cannot come inside anyone, through","Science. If he wants to, he can make an atom bomb."]],[982,["And if he wants he can make one or the other","good hospital but it is at his will."]],[990,["It is not a fixed thing, it is movable/transient. Today","he will build a big hospital, a huge one."]],[997,["He will cure thousands of people there and later one day,","can all of a sudden destroy it by dropping a bomb on it."]],[1006,["You can't guarantee that.","Does Science guarantee it"]],[1011,["that the man who is doing good work today because","of Science, will tomorrow not destroy it?"]],[1017,["Can you give any guarantee of man","with Science?"]],[1028,["When Science is so incomplete then we","should see why is it’s light so dim?"]],[1041,["Why is it so, that in it’s light a person is","sometimes seen standing on the path and","sometimes falls into the ditch?"]],[1049,["And as long as man is not capable or competent","enough, till the motivation or inspiration for Truth","is not strong enough in man,"]],[1058,["till then, whether you do any social work of the world,","any political work or any work with your intellect,","there’s no stability for him."]],[1066,["Today you will be high up in the sky, tomorrow you","will drown in the river because Science doesn’t","make any human being capable enough and cannot make."]],[1080,["No man can ever be competent or capable","enough with ego. ‘sam’ ‘arth’"]],[1091,["So must reach this result, what is called","the logical conclusion and think"]],[1098,["that with the intellect alone we cannot find the Truth."]],[1106,["By intellect we can tell that a white sheet is spread","here, that it is a khadi sheet - just this,","what else? How far can we go?"]],[1121,["But can you tell from this khadi sheet,","whether it was worn by a saint or a demon?"]],[1136,["With Science you can't even tell whether","this person is a demon or he is a human being?"]],[1141,["And can’t even say and don’t know whether the one","who looks like a human today, may tomorrow","become a ghost and sit on your head."]],[1148,["There is no surety of anything - everything","is mobile/unsustainable, unstable."]],[1152,["That's why nowadays in Kalyuga it is said that","man is completely in delusion, in confusion."]],[1162,["And in this tumult/uproar when man thinks that,","\"Hey, now Kalyuga has come,"]],[1168,["now what is Mataji talking about in this? Now","this is what happens in Kalyuga, this is Kalyuga.\""]],[1174,["It means that everything has become a guarantee. Now it","is Kalyuga, now in this, if you don’t do these things,"]],[1178,["so how will it happen? This has to be done,","this Kali Yuga has come."]],[1183,["In this, if you do not move on this path, then no","work is going to be done. This is the way. It is Kaliyuga."]],[1188,["No matter how you keep turning your path in Kalyug,","whichever way you go, somehow you keep on moving","right-left, somehow you keep living."]],[1197,["Such a person lives on compromises because","the values which were stable, they finish off."]],[1208,["When man becomes delusional, his constant/stable","values definitely end."]],[1213,["When the war challenged and when the war broke out","in the European countries, when there was","great plight of the people,"]],[1220,["so the values that were there, were greatly reduced,","were over, almost finished."]],[1227,["Because when everything started to waver/stagger,","then people could not understand that what","should they hold on to now."]],[1232,["If they hold on to this thing, it is wobbly","if they held on to that thing, it wobbled."]],[1237,["But then these thoughts should come to the mind of man,","that we may be we have not caught the thing","which is stable and immovable."]],[1245,["Such a thought must arise in the mind of every","intellectualist - this thought must arise in the mind."]],[1250,["Son, sit here, it is very cold there, come here.","There is a lot of space here. It's cold outside,","don't sit outside. Come sit here, don't sit outside."]],[1259,["Come ahead and sit here. You people come forward.","I can't talk comfortably if everyone will sit outside."]],[1264,["Sit here, what’s the problem? Spread something on it -","this is a good thing. Don't sit outside."]],[1290,["And seeing all this, the heart of man gets","filled with bitterness. His heart becomes very bitter","- he wonders where is the sweetness,"]],[1305,["where is the love! If one has to live somehow","then what is home?"]],[1315,["Some strangle themselves, some strangle others."]],[1321,["And in response thousands of people","will tell you thousands of things."]],[1326,["Some will say that the reason for this is social disorder,","some would say political disorder."]],[1331,["Some will say Communism is good, some will say","Capitalism is good, someone will say something good,","someone will say something else good."]],[1339,["And people will also stick to it. Some will become","a Communist, someone will become a Capitalist,"]],[1344,["some will become Democratic, some Socialist,","then someone will become poor,"]],[1347,["somebody will become rich - means by forming some or","the other group will think that they can live as a group."]],[1352,["and struggle, complete struggle and this struggle","also, they don't know what they want."]],[1364,["There is a Dalit party, someone is a terrorist party","a number of parties have been changed."]],[1375,["But among ourselves we are all human beings -","how did these parties come into being?"]],[1384,["There is a huge mystery behind this.","And the secret is that we cannot see the","love of that Supreme Father."]],[1403,["We do not understand with how much love","He has created this Universe."]],[1410,["You people can't make a tree out of a seed,","cannot make a fruit from a flower."]],[1427,["There is nothing you can do. Just think,","how much beauty God has given us"]],[1438,["and how much He has done for us."]],[1444,["This, man has forgotten, that the One who made us,","nurtured us - made a human-being from an amoeba,"]],[1454,["there is no gratitude towards Him, there is no attention","there is no thought towards Him,"]],[1464,["that's why incompleteness has come. And whatever was said","by those people, whatever was told to the other people, either","those who followed them, followed them wrongly."]],[1474,["They made groups out of them and some people said","that, “These are all useless things, there is no","meaning in them - everything is false.”"]],[1487,["In such a situation when a person is completely disappointed","and desperate, and full of bitterness,"]],[1495,["and in his sight there is no glimpse of the love of God."]],[1499,["Look in front of Me now, little-little leaves are visible","through the fog - how beautiful everything is made."]],[1507,["It’s joy is pouring within. And all this beauty","of creation has also disappeared from our eyes"]],[1517,["and we are burdened with a heavy life,","then we do not understand, why is it so?"]],[1527,["If God made us with His love, cherished us with","so much joy, He created this universe,"]],[1535,["then after all, why did we get trapped","in such a big trouble?"]],[1544,["The reason for this is that we ourselves","have got our necks cut/landed up in trouble."]],[1553,["Having necks cut - in Sahaja Yoga, what we call as","Vishuddhi Chakra, which is the place of Virata -"]],[1563,["having neck cut means that we have broken off","our relationship with the Virata."]],[1568,["From that Primordial Being of which we are part and parcel,","which is known as God Almighty,","we have broken off our relationship with Him"]],[1580,["and have gone astray in our own direction, and in our","own notions and ideas and in our own thoughts,"]],[1587,["thinking that this is the only thing right, and","the rest everything that is there is wrong."]],[1596,["At this juncture only, today Sahaja Yoga","has come before you as a Maha Yoga."]],[1607,["You cannot know it by thinking about it, because","I already said that by thinking, you will find","only the thing that is lower than you."]],[1615,["What is higher than you, is the stuff of your imagination.","In your imagination you can think that we are roaming","in the sky, anything, but that is not the reality."]],[1626,["That’s not real, it is not reality, it is not real.","It should be accepted that whatever we think,","that we are such and such,"]],[1635,["and this will happen, that will happen, is not real. Then this","must be understood that what we actually found,"]],[1644,["found only that which is lower than ourselves, and if","we have to find something that is higher than","ourselves, something has to be there in reality."]],[1654,["And also what should there be in reality,","the Creator has thought about it."]],[1661,["Only He is the doer. He also has the idea/concept. The One","who gave you these eyes, nose, mouth, everything, this body,"]],[1670,["mind, intellect, ego, etc all things are given in you,","He will also give you that peg, upon reaching which","you can come to a higher state than this."]],[1683,["With this thought only He has made you a human-being."]],[1688,["But first of all, the intellectual has to think","how far does this intellect reach?"]],[1693,["What a limited thing it is, and when it comes to the","unlimited, it is not right to rub the intellect between."]],[1705,["After knowing this infinite, after recognizing it,","as Nanak Saheb has said 'after recognizing it'"]],[1717,["then you can understand what are you,","why have you come into this world,"]],[1726,["and what work does this living Power of the","All-pervading Lord do, and how does It do it?"]],[1734,["Not only this, when the realization of the Spirit within you","happens, then this Power flows from within you","and is manifested."]],[1744,["You must pay attention to this word. This Power doesn’t","speak, doesn’t think, it acts, is manifested."]],[1758,["To speak and to think, is the work of the intellect -","useless – no work is done by it."]],[1763,["Just as you sit in the car and start thinking about it","- will your car move?"]],[1769,["Something has to be done. But this Power is such that when","it starts flowing from within you, then it is manifested,"]],[1779,["it works. As there is light, it is implemented.","When light is coming from it, then light is visible,"]],[1785,["is working, is automatic. Despite doing nothing,","being light it is giving light."]],[1793,["Similarly, such a person, while doing nothing,","can give light and is implemented."]],[1804,["This thing, I think, is said in/for the university because","because the meaning of university is Universal."]],[1813,["But intelligence cannot be universal.","If it had been, it would have happened by now."]],[1819,["Everyone's intellect moves to the same place.","one does not match the other."]],[1830,["So in order to achieve this thing, first","of all, we must humbly admit"]],[1836,["that whatever we have known so far is limited,","and in order to know the unlimited, some","happening must take place within us,"]],[1848,["some sprouting must take place within us, because today","that we seem so limited, we may become vast like the sky","and cover everything."]],[1860,["In many ways have the elders tried to explain","that the drop should be the ocean."]],[1867,["Now all similies that are there, also the analogies, are","also with the lower things. It’s a very big question"]],[1876,["from where to get that also because they can’t","even talk of higher things and those who give","analogies will do with lower things."]],[1883,["And whatever lower things they will give,","will pull you further down."]],[1888,["As soon as is said that, 'You become an ocean from a drop,’","they will say, 'Sir, how can we become an ocean from a drop?'"]],[1898,["No matter in whatever roundabout way it is explained,","it cannot be understood, because the one who wants","to understand, is a type of the intellect itself."]],[1907,["When understanding is possible only through the Spirit, then","you tell Me, what can be explained through the intellect."]],[1916,["Like many foreign Sahaja Yogis have come here,","they don’t even know the basic notes of your music -"]],[1926,["they know everything about their music. They don't know","anything about your musicology, don’t know","the names of your ragas"]],[1935,["but if any pure Indian classical music is played,","no matter how difficult the melody, they get","engrossed in that."]],[1945,["They don't search it’s melody, they don't talk about","it’s aalaapa, but its effect, its work,","develops within them."]],[1956,["Otherwise, if our Indians sit to listen to it, then","first they will ask, \"Who’s the one singing, sir?\""]],[1964,["Then, 'Which melody is this,' thought comes in between.","To which family does it belong, what is it’s lineage,","(which theka is being used),"]],[1974,["but the one who is not particular about this thing,","is just experiencing it with his Spirit,"]],[1980,["enjoying it, and the reason for which that melody was created,","that joy, is being absorbed by that person."]],[1989,["The joy with which it was made, that entire bliss,","is being absorbed in him and is manifesting."]],[1999,["All this joy can be experienced by you all","- it's our own. If you say, I will also accept this fact."]],[2011,["If you say, “Why only I’m doing this work?” then I’ll say,","you do it, it’s very good, you must certainly do it."]],[2018,["Then I’m very happy that you people do it,","it’s very good - anyone may do it."]],[2022,["What can be better than this, that someone else should","do the work instead of Me, that's a very good thing."]],[2027,["But it is such, that perhaps I will have to do","this work, for a few days at least."]],[2034,["If you can do it, then you do."]],[2037,["The work is complicated, it is the work of love.","And love is Truth and Truth is love."]],[2049,["This is such a deep love, that in it man immediately","recognizes, what is the problem with others."]],[2059,["There is not the other, it is such an intense love","– everyone is part and parcel of our being."]],[2066,["When there is not the other, whom","are you going to oblige?"]],[2075,["And when this love shines on anyone,","then the whole Truth of that person,","the complete is visible (in front)."]],[2087,["The whole thing, the complete picture comes","to the fore. In that light you come to know,"]],[2095,["what is the trouble in the one who is your","part and parcel – it manifests.(implemented)"]],[2101,["You must see in the light of the Spirit, clearly","it should be visible, there should be no mistake in it."]],[2107,["Not just one, everyone who will see, will say the","same thing, that Mother is wearing a white saree."]],[2116,["There can’t be many thoughts in it, there can be no","question of any quarrel in it - there can only be one Truth."]],[2129,["And the only one Truth that is, in spite of","being many, looks the same though."]],[2139,["But no one has known this love till date.","Very few have known, and those who have known,","no one wanted to know."]],[2147,["They harassed them, tormented them and after","their death erected temples, churches,"]],[2154,["and set up various gurudwaras, and all other things,","but did not know(feel) that love, which was the","basis of all these things."]],[2167,["In order to know that love, we will","have to depend on the Spirit."]],[2175,["Just as we rely on intelligence to know worldly things,","in the same way we have to rely on the Spirit","to know Supernatural(Divine) things."]],[2187,["Now someone will say whether there is the Spirit or not.","Why have you already started quarrelling?","Why is there such a fuss about it already?"]],[2200,["At least see whether it is or not. Now I","have come to prove it."]],[2206,["You could say about the people of the past whether they were true,","or fake - you can say many things about them."]],[2214,["But now I have come to prove it to you,","that within you is the seat of the Spirit"]],[2220,["and the Divine, omnipresent Lord","invites you to His kingdom."]],[2230,["This All-Pervading Power is the wave of","love of our Almighty Supreme Father."]],[2240,["Our Almighty Lord has created human-beings only to enjoy it.","Ego may delight a man but he can’t have joy, bliss."]],[2252,["Happiness can be followed by sadness, but in joy","both the feelings of happiness and sorrow are broken and","there is only joy,"]],[2262,["which cannot be described in words,","can only be experienced."]],[2267,["But even it’s experience is not from this heart","which you call as heart."]],[2275,["It should not be called the heart because if this is","the heart, then it sometimes makes us cry, sometimes laugh."]],[2285,["‘Hrid’- The one who knows - it is the Spirit. From the word ‘Ri’,","the meaning of ‘Ri’ is energy. Ra, ra, ra, means energy,","power. The One which gives this power of love, is the heart."]],[2306,["Therefore the Spirit, which is giver of the power","of love, or is the knower, should be attained."]],[2318,["So far, if all of you intellectuals reach/come down,","then I can talk of something further."]],[2327,["First come down to this much - it is a very important thing -","because otherwise your intelligence will stand up in between"]],[2334,["that, \"But Mother, how is it like this.\" On the","level of the intellect whatever reply I give,","you will not be satisfied."]],[2345,["because it won’t be a complete answer. Although","logically I have brought you to that point","where you will say that,"]],[2353,["\"Well then, tell me Mother, how to get this Spirit?\"","I hope that in all of you"]],[2360,["there may have been such a feeling, that whatever","Mother says, there is some truth in it."]],[2369,["Now you’ve asked to speak in English, so if someone","asks questions, I’ll reply in English."]],[2402,["Ask questions, ask anything, you people","are very learned."]],[2418,["Sahaja Yogi: What is the Spirit? What is the Spirit?"]],[2423,["Shri Mataji: What are you saying?","Sahaja Yogi: What is the Spirit?"]],[2427,["Shri Mataji: Spirit is the shadow of that Supreme Lord.","The Spirit is the reflection of God Almighty,","which may be visible in this human being."]],[2441,["Is the reflection. It is a reflection of God Almighty","in our heart. If the heart is a good ..."]],[2454,["[ASIDE - Yes this is better. If it’s a little","lukewarm, then will drink it. No tea.]"]],[2460,["If the heart is clean, like a clean mirror,","the reflection is the best."]],[2467,["It's just simple thing, is the reflection of","God Almighty within ourselves."]],[2475,["Seeker: Mother, please tell me whether Kundalini","and the Spirit, are both different things?","Shri Mataji: Okay child, sit down."]],[2482,["Shri Mataji: She has asked Me a question -","Should I tell in English, child?"]],[2487,["Seeker: Please tell in Hindi.","Shri Mataji: In Hindi, okay."]],[2491,["She has asked, what is the relationship between","Kundalini and the Spirit. Now I told you earlier,","that Spirit is the reflection of God."]],[2506,["This is one thing. And the power of God,","is known as Adishakti, is called Holy Ghost,","or if you like/want, you can call it ‘Ruh’."]],[2520,["The reflection of this power in a person","is the Kundalini."]],[2527,["As long as these two things do not meet, yoga","doesn’t take place. Yoga means union (unison)."]],[2537,["And as soon as this thing happens,","then as if, you understand,"]],[2547,["I’ll give an analogy again in a very gross way -","which is a very low/inferior thing -"]],[2552,["that as soon as this is connected to the mains,","then just by plugging it into the plug,","it’s connection is established -"]],[2567,["so in this we can say, that Kundalini is this,","and the plug is the Spirit."]],[2576,["Now it is a very gross thing, but what to do? Whatever","analogy is given, no matter how poetic it is made,","even then it will be inferior."]],[2588,["There is such a close relationship between","the two/with each other."]],[2595,["She asked me the question, what is the connection","between the Spirit and the Kundalini?"]],[2602,["I said, I was telling them in Hindi language a point,","that whatever we have to achieve or we achieve,"]],[2614,["or we describe, or talk about, is lower than us,","is not higher than us, because it is done through","our intelligence or through our emotions,"]],[2629,["so it's not higher than us, the whole thing","is lower than us, which we can handle."]],[2636,["In imagination you may think of some greater things,","higher things, but this imagination that’s not reality."]],[2643,["So in reality when have to deal with something, in reality"]],[2649,["then you deal with things that are lower than you."]],[2657,["That's why many people say that,","\"Mother, you are not practical.\""]],[2663,["Many people say that, \"Mother, you are","not practical,\" because to them it looks as if"]],[2668,["I have a very impractical attitude towards things,","because I must deal with the lower things."]],[2675,["Like I said in Bombay that, \"I will not pay any black money","or anything. If I don't get the land, doesn't matter.\""]],[2682,["So they thought I was not practical.","I must say that you should pay them."]],[2687,["By God’s grace, some man donated us one acre","of land, without even paying a single pie."]],[2698,["Sahaja Yogi: There’s another question Mother.","Why is man afraid of the dark?"]],[2704,["Shri Mataji: Not all human beings feel."]],[2708,["There’s a question - ‘Why a man is afraid of darkness?’","Not all.... Darkness is sometimes afraid of some men."]],[2723,["This thing is not right. The question is incomplete son.","But one is afraid because - the same thing has come,","hasn't it? That a person is afraid of the invisible."]],[2735,["And in the darkness, the mess that humans have done","on each other, that's why they’re afraid of it."]],[2740,["There are many other things, but the main thing is this","that, when there is darkness inside a man, then","he’s very scared."]],[2749,["When he comes into the light, he’s never","afraid of the dark and darkness."]],[2755,["It's dark inside, dark outside, so there’s too much","darkness. Man gets nervous"]],[2762,["that, 'Oh my God, as it is can’t find the way","and on top of it so much darkness.’"]],[2769,["But when there is light inside, the outside","darkness is no longer visible."]],[2776,["You think it's dark now, and I'm seeing","very beautiful things in it also."]],[2783,["Seeker: There are such big-big universities","inside our country and even outside, and the","Government also spends so much money"]],[2792,["and all the other people together and so many students","are engaged in it, day and night work laboriously"]],[2798,["and achieve something. According to You it","is inferior, of a lower level?"]],[2802,["Shri Mataji: Absolutely.","Seeker: So this system that You have made,"]],[2805,["for it’s arrangement, if there’s any provision","or system, can it not be given?"]],[2809,["Suppose someone is curious, has a desire to know,","and even if he’s not, then curiosity/inquisitiveness","could be created in him."]],[2815,["And to turn people that way too, some ashram system","or something of this type that was told before,","such arrangement is there."]],[2822,["Shri Mataji: I am telling about that condition only.","that they went to buy land for the ashram, then the","authorities started saying, \"Give black money.\""]],[2827,["Then they started saying, ‘You give bribe,’ -","while doing all this, 12 years have passed.","Now a gentleman has given the land."]],[2833,["Your President gave us land because I cured him. Thus","they gave us land in the vegetable market where bulls sit."]],[2843,["That's correct. You go and ask. Very peculiar,","insane people roam around the world, tell me."]],[2848,["Now they’ve given in the vegetable market. To this also","four years have passed. From the vegetable market","they took us here and there - this is what is going on."]],[2857,["As long as man's intellect is not proper, till then","I don't think even an ashram will be built."]],[2863,["Ashrams can be built only when people think that they","are needed. Otherwise only deserted universities","will be made here and no one will come in it at all."]],[2871,["That's why, first it should strike a little in","man's brain - it should definitely ring in,"]],[2876,["and that's why it will strike man in Kaliyuga only,","otherwise, this thing will not come to his mind."]],[2882,["By explaining like this, no one will understand. You tell Me,","today so many of you people are sitting here,"]],[2887,["how many learned people of this university are sitting here,","I mean, not professors but college boys are sitting"]],[2897,["Look, is there anyone - one, two, three, four, five, that's it.","Six - six children are sitting - you tell"]],[2908,["what should I do now? This university, in this Delhi University","for how many years I have been coming here, let me","tell you - for about 11-12 years."]],[2917,["Got six children in twelve years, now tell?","What should I do, son - from My side I’m working very hard."]],[2927,["Working tirelessly day and night but nobody comes here.","Then if it’s Delhi University, the condition is even worse."]],[2943,["And that which is your Jawaharlal Nehru University,","in that only one person came to listen to my lecture."]],[2949,["I just spoke to the walls.","There is absolutely a great need."]],[2958,["Unless these people are going to get into a lot of","trouble, till then, wisdom will not come into them."]],[2965,["Like, we have a lot of work being done abroad. At Cambridge","University, New York University, in Canada"]],[2972,["people are writing our thesis on Sahaja yoga, at three places.","Thesis is being written about Sahaja Yoga."]],[2983,["Would anyone in Delhi University do such a thing?","Would anyone here agree, that on Sahaja Yoga a","thesis should be written."]],[2991,["And even if they write, then such, so superficial,","that the work of Sahaja Yoga stops permanently."]],[2999,["They will say that Mother was sitting down wearing","a white saree, or her so-and-so is this or that,"]],[3007,["anything, they will say things whatever superficially they","understand with their minds, as newspaper things go."]],[3013,["Thus there’s a little need that it should hit/strike the","minds of the people here."]],[3017,["Without that, they cannot become sane, I think so."]],[3022,["Son, I’ve been coming here since twelve years, then this","is the condition; From this you can understand."]],[3028,["Now from this you can understand that I have not","shirked from hard work."]],[3034,["And there are many such people here who are realized.","130 people from abroad are also sitting here."]],[3042,["The same number from here are also sitting.","If people from abroad didn’t come, then even","this space would not have been occupied/full."]],[3049,["It is true. What should I do? People are not interested,","there’s no thought in this direction. They think","that they have become great people. What to say!"]],[3066,["Sahaja Yogi: There’s a gentleman who writes Mother,","\"I failed to join your lectures on awakening of","Kundalini on Mooladhara and Sahasrara Chakras."]],[3075,["Sahaja Yogi: My keen desire to learn the same by","tape recorder and I’m leaving to my native place","by 2nd or 3rd of this month."]],[3084,["Shri Mataji: Who’s it?","Sahaja Yogi: Some gentleman."]],[3087,["Shri Mataji: Who’s this gentleman? Alright. There is a","arrangement, that you can take my lectures, which is","taped and you can take from there. Alright?"]],[3102,["But you see, My lectures are of no use, if you","do not get your realization."]],[3108,["It’s a good thing, you see, because Mother speaks","well, you see, She’s good at speaking,"]],[3114,["so nice to listen to Her but you must","get your realization first, alright?"]],[3120,["Seeker: (Unclear – I’ve taken?)","Shri Mataji: You got it? Then you take it"]],[3122,["Then it’s alright, then you are my son.","Alright? You take whatever you like."]],[3130,["Sahaja Yogi: This same gentleman writes, \" During my 30 years","of experience in religion and yoga, I have"]],[3136,["not seen such a eminent person who, who’s got a","vast knowledge of Kundalini. Before I left Delhi"]],[3143,["I wish to learn more about Sahaja Yoga and","treatment. I came to Delhi last December."]],[3150,["Shri Mataji: To whom did he go?","Sahaja Yogi: To whom did you go first?"]],[3156,["Shri Mataji: Which eminent person did you visit?","Seeker: Mataji only"]],[3161,["Shri Mataji: Yes?","Seeker: You only, Mother."]],[3164,["Shri Mataji: What? Which Mother?","Seeker: Went to You."]],[3167,["Seeker: I’m telling about You Mother, I have learned from You only.","Shri Mataji: You learnt it from Me?"]],[3170,["Seeker: Yes.","Shri Mataji: You learnt it from Me?","Seeker: Yes."]],[3173,["Shri Mataji: Then it’s alright.","Sahaja Yogi: He’s talking 30 years of","experience in religion and yoga."]],[3178,["Shri Mataji: How did you get the experience of 30 years?","Hmm? I started my work only 12 years back."]],[3189,["Sahaja Yogi: He worked overtime.","Shri Mataji: It’s alright, doesn’t matter but you better","take the taperecorder"]],[3196,["if you got your realization even today,","you can take it, alright? That's all."]],[3201,["You see, because without Self-realization","it's just a tool in your hands,"]],[3205,["but once you get realized, it is a light in your","hands. Alright, that’s why. Give it to him."]],[3211,["You can take. We have got arrangements. Those who","want to take My tapes, can take it."]],[3216,["but you have to be a realized soul,","otherwise we don't give because what's the","use of this cheap popularity."]],[3224,["There's no need to have cheap popularity about","Sahaja Yoga - you have to become."]],[3230,["Here you cannot be just a member, we have no","membership, nothing – this is a living organism."]],[3236,["So, if you become, you have every right","but if you don't become, you have no right."]],[3243,["Just like, you have to be an Indian citizen to","have some rights in this country","– I wonder if we have any!"]],[3252,["But here in God’s, in the realm of God, if you","just enter into it, you have all the rights"]],[3263,["and He looks after you with every support, with","every help, so much so that you think you have"]],[3270,["now lost the meaning of miracles","- every step you will be amazed."]],[3282,["Sahaja Yogi: The same person he has asked,","something about, how to cure insomnia?"]],[3286,["Shri Mataji: Kill what?","Sahaja Yogi: Insomnia","Shri Mataji: Insomnia, alright."]],[3289,["Sahaja Yogi: and he says that, ‘I did not understand","last time because of 50% knowledge of Hindi.’"]],[3293,["Shri Mataji: Insomnia is absolutely curable. If you","have attended My lectures before this,"]],[3300,["I have told you how to give balance to yourself,","but in any case"]],[3304,["you come to the centre and they will tell you","how to cure insomnia. It’s absolutely simple."]],[3312,["Sahaja Yogi: A boy has written that, ‘For the","realization of the Spirit whatever formula","or whatever we can do,"]],[3319,["please tell, so that that energy can synchronize","or resonate with my body."]],[3325,["I am attending this discourse for the first time.","Shri Mataji: Huh?"]],[3329,["Sahaja Yogi: For the first time I have attended this discourse.","Shri Mataji: Okay"]],[3331,["Shri Mataji: Whose question is this?","Is it your son? It’s a matter of great happiness."]],[3337,["He asked the correct thing that, ‘I want to","have Self-realization.’ It will be done."]],[3342,["That's enough - it will happen. But when","this energy starts flowing through you"]],[3347,["then you have to learn about it, you have to know,","because the yoga has taken place but another meaning","of ‘yog’ is deftness/trick/tactics – skill."]],[3357,["After knowing Yoga, you should understand,","it’s tactics, how is it to be worked out."]],[3363,["Yoga does not have only one meaning. One meaning","of yoga is that union has taken place"]],[3367,["and after that it’s skill should come,","it’s deftness should come."]],[3374,["Done? No?","Seeker: You told us the Spirit,"]],[3382,["You have told us Atma(Spirit) is Parmatma (Almighty God),","Atma is the reflection of God. Then why is it"]],[3389,["then somebody passes away, we pray,","\"May God grant peace to the departed soul.\""]],[3395,["As if God and Atma are two different things.","Shri Mataji: No"]],[3399,["Seeker: That is true God is Supreme,","we have to pray …."]],[3401,["Shri Mataji: Alright, I’ll answer your question.","It’s not difficult to answer, because when you die,"]],[3406,["that time what happens to you is the part.","You just don’t only become the Atma, you become","the soul, you become a Jiva."]],[3413,["So with the Atma, Jiva is still with it and that's why","there’s darkness, because if Jiva is surrounding the Atma,"]],[3422,["we say that, \"Oh God, please give peace to this","Atma or to this Jivatma,”"]],[3427,["to his soul, not to his Atma, to his soul, to Jivatma","so that the person becomes a better person"]],[3437,["and when he is reborn, he doesn’t hanker. Even when","he’s dead, if his Jivatma is not happy or peaceful,"]],[3446,["he may hanker around, he may hover around, and may","create problems, that's why we say."]],[3453,["Atma itself is shanti(peace) itself but it is the","Jivatma, it’s not the Atma."]],[3460,["There are three elements still attached to the Atma.","Only the earth element and water element drop out.","The rest of it is still there."]],[3475,["Seeker: Is it for this realization that You have told,","can a man who’s a householder's achieve all this?"]],[3483,["Shri Mataji: If a person is not a householder,","then there will be no realization."]],[3487,["The opposite is the situation in Sahaja Yoga. In Sahaja Yoga if","if you do not stay in Grihastha Ashram (family life), then","there would be no benefit of Sahaja Yoga."]],[3493,["If there was a hermit, we would have told him,","‘Please change your clothes and come.’"]],[3500,["Family life is not to be abandoned at all","- don't know where all these ideas came from."]],[3506,["This is escapism."]],[3509,["Seeker: So much concentration, so much realization,","man does need solitude for all this."]],[3513,["Shri Mataji: Not necessary. Everything is within, son.","There is no need of solitude."]],[3518,["It takes place within, within yourself you find, and","in that you know that wherever you are sitting,"]],[3525,["in that environment only that power has come.","But if you go to the Himalayas,"]],[3531,["even after going there, you will remain worried.","And there too you would like to build something","around your hut"]],[3537,["and keep yourself safe somehow, but here when you","are awakened in the Spirit, then even being with","everyone, you remain calm inside."]],[3549,["Seeker: For spiritual growth, a man who","drinks alcohol, smokes cigarettes, eats meat,"]],[3555,["and as in the Muslim religion there are four wives,","there’s only one in Hindu religion, then this, in","that manner human being is the same in the whole world."]],[3562,["So many of these scholars have different views,","to enhance the powers of spiritual, spiritual development","(inaudible),"]],[3572,["Shri Mataji: No sir, not different notions"]],[3574,["Seeker: No, what is the difference in this? It’s said,","that one who smokes cigarettes is not good, eats meat","is not good,"]],[3580,["keeps five wives is not right – can’t have spiritual development","quickly - he himself"]],[3586,["Shri Mataji: I’ve understood, you sit down. I…."]],[3589,["Seeker: What about eating, drinking, wearing,","(inaudible)."]],[3591,["Shri Mataji: You please sit. See, those things","which are against the Spirit, should not be consumed."]],[3598,["That which opposes the Spirit, or consciousness(awareness),","should not be done."]],[3603,["Now when Mohammad Sahab came, he told,","\"Please don't drink alcohol,\" because until","then cigarette hadn’t come."]],[3610,["That's why he came as Nanak Saheb and","said, \"Please, don't smoke cigarettes now.\""]],[3614,["So now some people come and tell me, these two","have not said that, \"Don't smoke Ganja.\""]],[3620,["So I told them that, see, you make a list of all the","things that can be drunk or smoked, and give it to Me"]],[3625,["- I don't even know what all can be drunk","and what can be done -"]],[3629,["I mean, it's something like this, isn't it?","['Come bull kill me,]' this policy."]],[3633,["Sitting nicely, all of a sudden started","drinking, so what to say to them."]],[3638,["But now supposing it may be, that I haven’t mentioned","one or two things and I left this world"]],[3644,["then people will say that, ‘Mataji","didn't disallow this thing, so do this only.’"]],[3648,["Just understand, that the thing which goes against","our awareness, means"]],[3657,["that the alcohol you drink does it go against","your consciousness or not - straight calculation."]],[3663,["Isn’t it, then don't do that. Smoking a cigarette,","doesn’t it cause cancer, it goes against your body."]],[3670,["Now about eating meat nobody has said, 'Don't eat meat'"]],[3674,["No one has said like this, 'Don't eat meat.'","These are made up things."]],[3678,["Didn't say so, but this they have definitely said","that, ‘Whatever it is, eat balanced food.’"]],[3683,["If you are vegetarian, stay vegetarian.","But when people come upon eating meat, they","eat fish, chicken, horse, etc. every possible thing."]],[3695,["And when it comes to vegetarianism, then they go to such","extremes that, they will save bed bugs, mosquitoes,","there should be some point in doing so."]],[3706,["Everything must have a reason. Does it mean anything,","like you understand there are some people"]],[3712,["that to mosquito – now, can I give realisation to a","mosquito? - a straight reckoning - can I give?"]],[3718,["can it be given to bedbugs, given to chickens","- can't give."]],[3723,["But a person should eat what he needs","according to his body requirements."]],[3729,["but if people want to eat only dirty stuff,","what can you say?"]],[3734,["One should eat whatever suits him. Now it means","- Nanak Saheb was there, he used to eat meat."]],[3742,["Kabirdas used to eat meat, our Mohammad Sahab","used to eat, Rama used to eat, Buddha also ate,"]],[3751,["and Mahavira also used to eat. But it was not","such with them that when they came upon eating,","then only (thought of eating)ate."]],[3758,["Because eating and drinking then affects the Spirit,","when such tendencies come within you,"]],[3765,["that you become violent. And it affects also","when you just become lazy – like cabbages."]],[3775,["Some people are there, who become just as if they","have absolutely no strength in them."]],[3781,["Now you will see that diseases also","come from extreme tendencies."]],[3785,["People who eat a lot of meat are oppressive,","they are arrogant."]],[3791,["And what diseases come in them?","Such people may have high blood pressure,"]],[3802,["can have a heart attack due to overactivity.","And supposing those who live only on grass,"]],[3803,["they get all lethargies, they have(get) lethargic heart."]],[3807,["A gentleman had come today itself - he was Agarwal.","Poor thing, he said that he had lethargic heart,","lethargic liver, lethargic intestines."]],[3815,["So I said, see you can’t eat meat","because you've never eaten"]],[3820,["but what you should do is to eat more protein.","So, \"Where's the protein, Mother?\" I said you","can get it, look for it. You can't eat any more,"]],[3828,["you’ve eaten a lot of it. You shouldn’t eat carbohydrates.","This is a thing/matter to be explained."]],[3833,["Now someone has said that it is written in Gita.","However, I would only say that in Gita, Krishna said","right in the beginning,\"Arjuna, you kill all of them.\""]],[3844,["He didn't even talk of non-violence, means,","don't know how He was brought/put into non-violence."]],[3849,["He’s told to kill a human being, leave alone an","animal, and above it all, even to kill the Guru."]],[3855,["So how will he say, \"You don't kill this, don’t kill that.\"","He‘s said in the beginning that, ‘Everyone is dead.’"]],[3861,["Such opposite things have also happened everywhere.","In the Bible also they’ve done many mistakes."]],[3867,["Such things have been done in the Quran too","- this is everyone's business, because if they","don't do this, how will they manage."]],[3874,["They make something like that, that something","or the other becomes a group."]],[3883,["All these that are, have made groups. A thing to","understand is, that which goes contrary to our","consciousness(awareness), all alcohol etc. goes against."]],[3890,["That's why everyone has spoken against alcohol, even Moses.","Now you will say that Jesus did not say,"]],[3896,["but it’s not like that. Jesus Christ is born here,","and at this place something else had to be done."]],[3902,["Wherever what is to be said, that only will be talked about.","Now if I have come for the awakening of Kundalini,","then I will talk about it only to you."]],[3909,["But this time is such that I have to talk about everything,","otherwise I'm afraid, that whatever I don’t talk about today,","you will keep holding on to that only."]],[3917,["Thus it’s better I talk about all the things, but","even then, those of you have to catch, will catch."]],[3923,["Those who have only one work from morning to evening","to point out/catch - loop holes which are called -"]],[3928,["like, now if someone goes to a thief and asks","about a bank, then he will tell that how","you can get into it - clearly."]],[3939,["But if you ask it’s manager, he will say,","see, there is strength in this, that is strong."]],[3945,["But only a thief can tell how you can enter in,","no matter how strong you make it, even then","they will show you by entering it."]],[3952,["This is the quality of man. Every religious preacher","has tried his best to bring man to sense."]],[3960,["Now Mahavirji has been taken to such an extent that","now bedbugs ... bedbug - brought one,"]],[3966,["a Brahmin, told him that, ‘We’ll put bugs on you","and will give you this much money.’"]],[3972,["Then when those bedbugs suck his blood, the Brahmin","is allowed to go - thus a great religious work has been done."]],[3978,["‘We fed so many bedbugs with the blood","of a Brahmin.’ Now is this any way?"]],[3988,["Man has a lot of sense but very less in the","matter of religion. And to think too much","of food is also not correct."]],[4004,["You tell Me, the person who thinks day and night","only about eating and drinking, how will he","achieve the Spirit?"]],[4010,["Now if one is to fast, so the person will keep","thinking about it only, as to what they","will have tomorrow when they fast."]],[4014,["And there’ll be so much commotion – as if","Shri Hanumana has incarnated – that it’s their fast."]],[4020,["It can be known from a distance that there is","someone fasting. God save us from such people."]],[4025,["In Sahaja Yoga there’s a rule that no one","will fast in the name of God."]],[4030,["If you want to do it for yourself then do it but the","man who will fast, should go out of the village"]],[4035,["because no one should listen to them.","Here, everyone has a sense of martyrdom,"]],[4039,["\"I’ve fasted so much, so I can trouble everyone.\""]],[4043,["\"I’ve sacrificed so much for the country,","so I can annoy/distress everyone.\""]],[4046,["Why did you do, who told you? That too is a","martyrdom, just a mental projection.","Done is done - live in peace."]],[4064,["So the idea of excessive eating and drinking","is also not correct. But get your realization","first, then we'll talk."]],[4071,["Because in doing now, you’ll rely on the logic","of the intellect, so first get your realization."]],[4075,["There’s no compulsion of anything for eating","and drinking but don't eat the animals","that are bigger than us."]],[4081,["And in Sahaja Yoga it is not that all of you","should eat meat or you have to eat this only","- whatever you are eating is fine."]],[4087,["Don't eat too much - eat less but not so little","that you starve."]],[4091,["Be in the centre, is the middle path.","Don't take an extreme view of anything."]],[4099,["You keep your diet according to the disease."]],[4103,["I will only speak on this, who has to eat protein,","who has to eat carbohydrates, and who has to eat fats."]],[4111,["Did you understand, and on this you decide","whichever type of food you want to eat."]],[4115,["Too much thinking about it, the attention and","mind of our Indians is only on food."]],[4120,["This is also the matter. Indians think a lot about food.","Don't know why all day and night they think"]],[4125,["so much of food and throw a lot of tantrums while/in eating.","In no country have I seen people with so many tantrums","as there are in India."]],[4132,["And though, so to say, we are poor people, but the","tantrums of Indians, you won't find such people","anywhere, (as Indians)how much we fuss about it."]],[4141,["The woman is, she is also smart. She too makes different","varieties of food and spoils the tongue(taste) of man"]],[4148,["because it’s a good way to call back her man home","- first spoil his tongue."]],[4153,["When he’s under her control, then he","runs back, for the taste of his tongue."]],[4159,["And so many tantrums with respect to food,","that I can't tell you."]],[4163,["As it is now in Bengal, they will eat Rohu fish.","Rohu is not found there, then they will eat Rohu -","they’ll eat only what is not available."]],[4170,["And that goes from Central India. Once Rohu fish","was not found there - means in their place","it can be found in small-small ponds -"]],[4177,["so they started dying of hunger. Then some people","from our Bombay collected a lot of money","and sent a whole ship full."]],[4185,["They sent it back, that, ‘We don’t eat sea fish.’","Look at their greatness!"]],[4191,["And all of the ships they came back","- 'We cannot eat sea fish.'"]],[4195,["Go and see anywhere there’s no one like this in the world,","the one who doesn't eat sea fish - he eats this fish."]],[4201,["Sitting down to eat, this is needed, that is needed, salt","is not proper in it - all this does not happen anywhere."]],[4206,["This is in our own country only and so much","are we fond of food, there is no limit to it."]],[4212,["That's why, just for a while, you forget about eating."]],[4216,["After a while it'll be dinner time - now is not the time."]],[4222,["Sahaja Yogi: Is Truth beyond the sense perception","or is Truth whatever we perceive and whatever","we do not perceive?"]],[4229,["Shri Mataji: Yes, it’s correct. This is a very good","question - is Truth beyond sense perception?"]],[4236,["It is absolutely. Because if we perceive through","our senses whatever we perceive, through our senses"]],[4247,["is the truth, then we don’t have to seek any more.","Whatever we perceive through our senses, is","what is very apparent, gross - not the subtle."]],[4265,["What is behind the gross we cannot perceive."]],[4269,["For example, we cannot say how to make an atom."]],[4278,["We cannot say how an amoeba is made","into a human-being."]],[4283,["We cannot make one monkey into a human-being","- can we – through our perception of the senses"]],[4290,["Through our perception of the senses we cannot do","the subtle thing which is behind the gross. So","we cannot perceive through the senses"]],[4304,["but once you have perceived it you can feel","it through your senses."]],[4309,["This is the second point. Done now? I think,","let us have meditation first."]],[4317,["What’s the question?"]],[4319,["Seeker: What one shall do or practice,","no.1, for purification of his mind of thoughts,"]],[4327,["no.2, for shedding complex within oneself"]],[4331,["Shri Mataji: Alright.","Seeker: and no.3, for creating self-confidence in himself."]],[4336,["Shri Mataji: It’s very good question. Sit down.","Now, you have to just get to your Spirit(Atma).","You have to become your Spirit."]],[4344,["That once happens to you, the first thing that","happens actually when the Kundalini rises,"]],[4351,["when She crosses this Agnya chakra, you get","Nirvichara Samadhi(thoughtless awareness),","you get beyond thoughts."]],[4356,["That’s first thing happens. Then, how to","get your confidence? Atma is your confidence, because","so far you have not known your properties,"]],[4369,["You have not known your wealth, you have not known","your beauties, your glories."]],[4374,["Only through the eyes of the Atma, when you’ll","discover how tremendous you are, you will know it."]],[4380,["For example, till this instrument is not connected","to the mains, it has no meaning, it is zero,","it has no value."]],[4387,["But once it is connected, it has the value. In the same way,","you are connected to the mains, you have your own value."]],[4392,["When you know your value, your whole value system","changes and you evaluate it yourself in a different way,"]],[4400,["that you know you are the Spirit. That’s how","you get your confidence."]],[4405,["Now the purification part of it, that also without","the light you cannot purify yourself."]],[4410,["Whatever purification you do in darkness, one side you","may be cleansing, another side you may be dirty."]],[4417,["It happens very much in life. See, some people","say, \"I’m going to conquer my ego.”"]],[4422,["You cannot conquer it. You go on fighting with it, you see."]],[4424,["It fights with you and if you try to put down","your ego, you get your super ego."]],[4429,["Means, you get a meek person,","you become like a cabbage."]],[4432,["Either you become this or that","- you cannot be in the centre."]],[4435,["Now with Kundalini what happens. When She raises, comes","up here – at this point when it is awakened, this centre,"]],[4443,["it sucks in, it sucks in from both the sides,","your ego and your super ego."]],[4449,["both the things - your conditionings, your sins and","everything and on the other side your ego,"]],[4453,["both are sucked in. Once it is sucked in","immediately what happens,"]],[4458,["that your Sahastrara is open - this part, the fontanel bone","area and the Brahmarandhra opens in and you","enter into that subtle awareness."]],[4466,["So, all the so-called karmas and all things are sucked in.","After all, who does the karma - is the ego."]],[4472,["Once it is sucked in, there is no ego left.","In that egolessness you become one with God.","So, it is a spontaneous, automatic happening."]],[4484,["As a result of the Kundalini awakening,","all these things happen immediately."]],[4496,["Sahaja Yogi: What was the Soul before entering the body?","Shri Mataji: Huh/What?"]],[4499,["Sahaja Yogi: What was the Soul before entering","the body and what happens to it after death?"]],[4505,["Shri Mataji: Now he's wants to ask - he’s asking that,","what is the Soul before the birth and what is the Soul after?"]],[4511,["Son, just now you're a human being, alright? Just now","you should not worry about these things."]],[4519,["Everything you cannot know in one lecture,","- can you?"]],[4523,["So now, don't worry about these things.","Why worry about the past or the future?"]],[4529,["because the past is finished (ASIDE - What? Having tea)","The past is finished and the future doesn’t exist."]],[4539,["So we have to be in the present. Now, how to","be in the present? Just now, if I say, pay","attention to yourself - can you pay attention?"]],[4545,["That’s why, let the Kundalini rise, you get","your realization, then we’ll talk of the past and","the future. Just now you get the present."]],[4558,["Sahaja Yogi: Last question, Mother. According to You,","the Spirit and Divine unite through Sahaja Yoga."]],[4563,["If this happens, then why did our saints, sages etc.","go to a secluded place on the Himalayan Mountains"]]]);
